":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos J. Vazquez","x":"In response to lower interest rates and the effect of the pandemic on our business, we will be implementing various cost savings initiatives that will affect personnel-related expenses, professional fees, business promotion and other operating expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/popular-inc-bpop-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BPOP 2020 Q2","e":"bpop","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos J. Vazquez","x":"Last quarter, we announced that in response to lower interest rate and the effect of the pandemic, we implemented various cost savings initiative, affecting personnel-related expenses, professional fees, business promotions and other operating expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/popular-inc-bpop-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BPOP 2020 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ignacio Alvarez","x":"These actions will impact 83 employees, who will be receiving severance and transition assistance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/popular-inc-bpop-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2020 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos Vazquez","x":"In the first quarter, we announced that in response to lower interest rates and the effect of the pandemic, we implemented various cost saving initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/popular-inc-bpop-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2020 Q4","e":"bpop","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos Vazquez","x":"…in expenses would have been $1.7 million, primarily driven by a $6.3 million increase in personnel cost composed of a $2.1 million severance expense related to Popular Bank's branch network realignment, higher 401(k) match due to an additional by weekly payroll and higher incentive compensation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/popular-inc-bpop-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2020 Q4","e":"bpop","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos Vazquez","x":"In response to the pandemic, we implemented various cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/popular-inc-bpop-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2021 Q1","e":"bpop","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos J. Vazquez","x":"We continue to expect public deposit balances to come down over time, driven by the restructuring of the public sector debt and the eventual restart of current debt service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/popular-inc-bpop-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2021 Q1","e":"bpop","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ignacio Alvarez","x":"The pension is very much tied into that deal because, obviously, the restructuring plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/popular-inc-bpop-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2021 Q2","e":"bpop","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos J. Vazquez","x":"We continue to expect positive deposit balances to come down over time during my outlays of funds advanced from the Cares and Jobs Act, the restructuring of public sector debt and the return to current debt service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/popular-inc-bpop-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2021 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carlos J. Vazquez","x":"We continue to expect public deposit balances to come down over time, driven by the restructuring of public sector debt and the return to current debt service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/popular-inc-bpop-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2025 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lidio V. Soriano","x":"And management has indicated their intent to right-size the capital structure, including liability management, the liability structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/popular-bpop-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2025 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"We are optimistic that these trends will persist given the backlog of obligated federal disaster recovery funds, announced real estate and tourism development projects, as well as the renewed focus on restructuring by global manufacturing companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/popular-bpop-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2025 Q3","e":"bpop","d":"2025-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Timur Braziler","x":"I am just wondering from an NII standpoint, you guys reiterated the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/popular-bpop-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2025 Q4","e":"bpop","d":"2026-01-27","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Timur Braziler","x":"And as you start looking out throughout the course of 2026, do you see this being a tough comp year kind of throughout the year, or do trends start getting better maybe post-April once you kind of lapse through some of the pull forward when tariffs first got announced last year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/popular-bpop-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BPOP 2025 Q4","e":"bpop","d":"2026-01-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kelly Motta","x":"You know, we did not pass through all the increases in the loan pricing, and we are seeing kind of the benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/popular-bpop-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends"